@prefix kg: <https://example.org/kg/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

kg:SupportOntology a owl:Ontology .
kg:ticketEmail a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain kg:SupportTicket .
kg:ticketTextReference a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain kg:SupportTicket .
